OL,3,GNEWSARobinson says he 'hopes' Carla
OL,4,ALockhart will stay amid DUP 'joint
OL,5,Aengagements' ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe leader of the Democratic Unionist
OL,8,FParty (DUP) has said he does not want
OL,9,Fto see Carla Lockhart leave the party.
OL,11,FLockhart has called for the DUP to
OL,12,Fremove First Minister Michelle O'Neill
OL,13,Ffrom office by having Emma
OL,14,FLittle-Pengelly resign from her role as
OL,15,Fdeputy first minister.
OL,17,FHowever on Thursday, the DUP confirmed
OL,18,Fthat Little-Pengelly will not
OL,19,Fparticipate in joint engagements with
OL,20,FO'Neill and permission will not be
OL,21,Fgranted for the first minister to
OL,22,Foperate on a solo basis.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
