OL,3,GNEWSARobinson says he 'hopes' Carla
OL,4,ALockhart will stay amid DUP 'joint
OL,5,Aengagements' ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FSinn Fein MP John Finucane called the
OL,8,Fmove "an example of economic sabotage,
OL,9,Fof self-harm, by the DUP all because
OL,10,Fthey struggle with internal party
OL,11,Fcohesion and once again that division".
